==Distribution==
''Cleistocactus hyalacanthus'' is distributed in the wooded dry forest of the Argentinian provinces of Salta and Jujuy at altitudes of 1700 to 3100 meters and possibly in southern Bolivia.<ref name="e106">{{cite journal | last=Lowry | first=Martin | title=A synopsis of the genus''Cleistocactus''Lemaire (Cactaceae) | journal=Bradleya | publisher=British Cactus and Succulent Society | volume=34 | issue=34 | year=2016 | issn=0265-086X | doi=10.25223/brad.n34.2016.a6 | pages=148–186}}</ref>
